{"id":"70a18be302d94faf","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-singular-support.md","title":"Singular Support","display":"df-singular-support — Singular Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-singular-support","aliases":["58-df-singular-support"],"display":"df-singular-support — Singular Support","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","[[58-df-open-set]]","[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-test-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]]","[[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-singular-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-singular-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-singular-support — Singular Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md\">../batch03/58-df-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c664c247a9331632\" href=\"?note=c664c247a9331632\" title=\"58-df-open-set\">58-df-open-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md\">../batch06/58-df-test-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a6c5654857edae16\" href=\"?note=a6c5654857edae16\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(X,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(X,n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_X=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(X,n)\">\\(\\mathcal T_X=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(X,n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,f,S,U,\\phi,\\widetilde\\phi\\in V\">\\(T,R,f,S,U,\\phi,\\widetilde\\phi\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D(U)\">\\(\\mathcal D(U)\\)</span> 保留书内的实值紧支集光滑测试函数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D&#39;(U)\">\\(\\mathcal D&#39;(U)\\)</span> 保留其复值分布空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb C)\">\\(C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb C)\\)</span> 使用实部与虚部的复化定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对欧氏开集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_U\">\\(\\mathcal B_U\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_U\">\\(\\lambda_U\\)</span> 是 <code>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</code> 给出的 Borel 集族和 Lebesgue 限制测度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-signed-integral-data</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{singsupp}_{X,\\mathcal T_X,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{singsupp}_{X,\\mathcal T_X,n}\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\">\\(T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\\)</span> 上定义；零延拓、限制与正则分布由以下关系定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributionRestriction}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistributionRestriction}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributionSmoothOn}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistributionSmoothOn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularDistribution}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularDistribution}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularSupport}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularSupport}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroExtension}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroExtension}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegularDistribution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,f,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\n\\land f\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R,\\mathcal D(U),\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(U)\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\\bigl(R(\\phi),\n\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\phi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\},U,\\mathcal B_U,\\lambda_U\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegularDistribution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,f,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\n\\land f\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R,\\mathcal D(U),\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(U)\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\\bigl(R(\\phi),\n\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\phi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\},U,\\mathcal B_U,\\lambda_U\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZeroExtension}_S(\\widetilde\\phi,\\phi,U,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\subseteq X\\land\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(U)\\land\\widetilde\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\widetilde\\phi=\\phi\\cup\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in X\\setminus U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZeroExtension}_S(\\widetilde\\phi,\\phi,U,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\subseteq X\\land\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(U)\\land\\widetilde\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\widetilde\\phi=\\phi\\cup\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in X\\setminus U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DistributionRestriction}_S(R,T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(X,n)\n\\land\\mathcal T_X=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land U\\in\\mathcal T_X\\land T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R,\\mathcal D(U),\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(U)\\;\\exists\\widetilde\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(X)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroExtension}_S(\\widetilde\\phi,\\phi,U,X)\n\\land R(\\phi)=T(\\widetilde\\phi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DistributionRestriction}_S(R,T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(X,n)\n\\land\\mathcal T_X=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land U\\in\\mathcal T_X\\land T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R,\\mathcal D(U),\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(U)\\;\\exists\\widetilde\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(X)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroExtension}_S(\\widetilde\\phi,\\phi,U,X)\n\\land R(\\phi)=T(\\widetilde\\phi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributionSmoothOn}_S(T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DistributionRestriction}_S(R,T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularDistribution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,f,U,n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DistributionSmoothOn}_S(T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DistributionRestriction}_S(R,T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularDistribution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,f,U,n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularSupport}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(X,n)\n\\land\\mathcal T_X=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(X,n)\n\\land T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land S=X\\setminus\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\mathcal T_X:\n\\mathrm{DistributionSmoothOn}_S(T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularSupport}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(X,n)\n\\land\\mathcal T_X=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(X,n)\n\\land T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land S=X\\setminus\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\mathcal T_X:\n\\mathrm{DistributionSmoothOn}_S(T,U,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{singsupp}_{X,\\mathcal T_X,n}(T)=S\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SingularSupport}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(X)\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{singsupp}_{X,\\mathcal T_X,n}(T)=S\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SingularSupport}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal T_X,n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实测试空间和原有谓词名、参数顺序不变。正则分布的积分取值由书内复积分关系给出，不再以未展开的元语言谓词代替。欧氏开域及其诱导拓扑是测试函数与限制运算的适用条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"c664c247a9331632","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0d